      "id": 6,
      "phase": 0,
      "text": "ADR-011: the product now depends on a live Colab/Kaggle session. Tunnel URL rotates on every restart, cold start is minutes, and a dead session takes the whole app down. Mitigations are the Kaggle backup, a pre-warmed data/cache/, and a recorded demo \u2014 none built yet."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "phase": 0,
      "text": "Accounts needed are now Supabase, Colab, Kaggle, HuggingFace, Streamlit Cloud. Google AI Studio and Groq keys are NOT used. Created by hand; the config page is the only check."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "phase": 5,
      "text": "Base Qwen 2.5 3B will extract worse than a frontier model did. That gap is what Phase 10 exists to close and Phase 11 measures \u2014 do not treat early Phase 5 quality as a failure."
    }
